      <activity id="f2726f5d-a4ba-5d2e-90ba-85232722d79d" activityNameId="b4043f2c-473f-59aa-8916-1322cb42e0c8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Inverter, 2500W, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Inverter, 2500W, at plant
Production of an inverter (2500W) with an efficiency of 93.5% (total efficiency factor which includes MPP-Tracking) for photovoltaic plant. Total weight about 18.5 kg.;
Synonyms: inverse rectifier; 
UUID: 39068f0a-81e9-31c5-af5a-77a40e87c99b
Materials, packaging and electricity use for the production of an inverse rectifier. Disposal of the product after use.
Location: Production in RER.
Technology: Inverter for a photovoltaic grid-connected system with a capacity of 2.5kWp.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Detailed analysis of materials for one product 
Extrapolations: Data for electronic components has been extrapolated from 500 W-Inverter
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_39068f0a-81e9-31c5-af5a-77a40e87c99b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
